OL,3,AAI 'kill switch' may need to be
OL,4,Amandatory, Anthropic co-founder tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn artificial intelligence "kill
OL,8,Fswitch" which can be checked by a third
OL,9,Fparty may need to be mandatory for
OL,10,Fcompanies, a co-founder of one of the
OL,11,Fworld's largest AI firms has told the
OL,12,FBBC.
OL,14,FJack Clark, one of seven founders of
OL,15,FAnthropic, said a way of shutting off
OL,16,FAI software completely if it gets too
OL,17,Fdangerous was something society "might
OL,18,Fwant to eventually pass rules around".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
