OL,3,AAI 'kill switch' may need to be
OL,4,Amandatory, Anthropic co-founder tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FClark said "most labs have different
OL,8,Fways of being able to pull the plug",
OL,9,Fincluding Anthropic, but said lawmakers
OL,10,Fmay need to enforce having one.
OL,12,FAI's rapid development and fears over
OL,13,Fthe risks it poses to humanity have
OL,14,Fbeen thrust into the spotlight by a
OL,15,Fseries of warnings from executives and
OL,16,Fstaff at AI firms.
